ost recently used position. If the key does not exist,\n        -1 is returned.\n        \n        Args:\n            key: The key to look up.\n        \n        Returns:\n            The value associated with the key, or -1 if not found.\n        \"\"\"\n        if key not in self.cache:\n            self.m",
